This repository carries two licences, because it holds two different kinds
of thing.

THE CODE, everything under pipeline/, is released under the MIT licence
reproduced below.

THE DATA, meaning the nine Parquet tables attached to the releases, the
capa reports, the raw JSON extractions, and the files under mapping/,
audit/ and results/, are released under the Creative Commons Attribution
4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0), whose full text is at
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

No executable is redistributed. Benign binaries were not collected for
redistribution and remain under the licences of their publishers; malicious
binaries were deleted after measurement. Only derived measurements and
content hashes are released.

If you use the corpus, cite the paper. See CITATION.cff.

